Here's a subtle bug! `registertable = xmalloc(sizeof(...) * REG_TABLE_SIZE)` — REG_TABLE_SIZE = TIC4X_REG_MAX + 1 = 34. Then tic3x_registers are filled in. For tic4x registers, tic4x_registers[i].regno includes REG_R8..REG_R11 (28-31), REG_IVTP (32), REG_TVTP (33).

